    <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-626" contextRef="c-35">&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="f-628" contextRef="c-35">&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, GeezaPro, &amp;quot;DejaVu Serif&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"&gt;On March 31, 2026, Victor Mullin, the Company's President, officially retired from the Company.Joris Veldhoven was hired on March 2, 2026, and has assumed the responsibilities of this position as president.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
    <ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock id="f-630" contextRef="c-35">&lt;p&gt;2. None&lt;/p&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfAcquisitionOfOwnershipInOtherCompaniesByReorganizationMergerOrConsolidationWithOtherCompaniesTextBlock>
