			&lt;td style="width: 1.35pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.45pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 68.4pt; border-bottom: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;(48,756,455) &lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 1.2pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 223.9pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: 16.2pt; text-align: justify"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;Utility plant, net&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.45pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 68.4pt; border-top: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 1.5pt double rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;1,206,051,789&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.35pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 1.45pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 68.4pt; border-top: 0.75pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-bottom: 1.5pt double rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: right; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;1,172,466,745&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 			&lt;/table&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-indent: -28.8pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Bold&amp;quot;; font-weight: bold"&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 20.46pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Debt&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Revolving Credit Agreement&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On November 27, 2019, the Company originally entered into a $100 million revolving credit agreement (the &amp;quot;November 2019 CA&amp;quot;) to fund all related project activities for the Segment B Project, which was amended and extended several times, resulting in a total credit facility of $370 million, a maturity date of January 31, 2025 and a provision to reduce the commitment under the agreement to $100 million upon permanently financing the cost of the Segment B Project. (the &amp;quot;Amended November 2019 CA&amp;quot;).&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;In January 2024, the Company repaid the $335 million outstanding balance on the Amended November 2019 CA from the proceeds of the 2024 Senior Notes, as defined below. In November 2024, the Amended November 2019 CA was further amended to extend the maturity date to March 31, 2026, and for it to also be used to finance capital expenditures associated with the Propel Project.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;In March 2026, the Amended November 2019 CA was amended to extend the maturity date to March 31, 2027, and the Company borrowed an additional $20 million under the Amended November 2019 CA. As of March 31, 2026 and December 31, 2025, the Company had $95 and $75 million, respectively, outstanding under the Amended November 2019 CA at an interest rate of 4.73% and 4.77%, respectively.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;In April 2026, the Company amended and restated the Amended November 2019 CA, increasing the maximum borrowings to $300 million and extending the maturity date to April 23, 2029.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;As of March 31, 2026, two letters of credit were outstanding totaling $1.5 million related to the provision of security in accordance with the terms of interconnection agreements for the Segment B Project. &lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Senior Notes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On May 24, 2016, the Company issued $104,387,000 aggregate principal amount of 2.91% Senior Notes, due May 24, 2046 (the &amp;quot;2016 Senior Notes&amp;quot;). The proceeds from the 2016 Senior Notes were used to finance capital expenditures.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;On January 9, 2024, the Company issued $350,000,000 aggregate principal amount of 5.45% Senior Notes, due January 9, 2054 (the &amp;quot;2025 Senior Notes&amp;quot;). The proceeds from the 2025 Senior Notes were used to repay the balance on the As Amended November 2022 CA and to finance capital expenditures.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Debt Covenants&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company's debt requires compliance with certain covenants, the most restrictive of which, include maintaining a ratio of consolidated debt to consolidated total capitalization of no more than 65% and that priority debt cannot exceed 15% of consolidated net worth. As of March 31, the Company is in compliance with all covenants.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-indent: -28.8pt; text-align: justify; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Arial Bold&amp;quot;; font-weight: bold"&gt;6.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 20.46pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 28.8pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The following is a summary of the components of federal, state and local income:&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left: 26.6pt; border-collapse: collapse" class="e-rte-table"&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 23.05pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 172.85pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: justify; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 4.05pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 98.1pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Three Months Ended&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;March 31, 2026&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 4.05pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 4.05pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: top"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 98.5pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: middle"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Three Months Ended&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: center; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;March 31, 2025&lt;/span&gt; 						&lt;/p&gt; 					&lt;/td&gt; 				&lt;/tr&gt; 				&lt;tr style="height: 1pt"&gt; 					&lt;td style="width: 172.85pt; padding-right: 5.4pt; padding-left: 5.4pt; vertical-align: bottom"&gt; 						&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 12pt"&gt; 							&lt;span&gt;State and local income tax&lt;